<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <title>OpenHat Security Linux packages</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 42rem; margin: 3rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; line-height: 1.5; }
    code, pre { background: #f4f4f5; padding: 0.15em 0.4em; border-radius: 4px; }
    pre { padding: 1rem; overflow-x: auto; }
    h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; }
    h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>OpenHat Security packages</h1>
  <p>Shared apt + dnf repositories for OpenHat CLI tools. Pool: <a href="deb/">deb/</a> · <a href="rpm/">rpm/</a>.</p>

  <h2>runhug</h2>
  <p><a href="https://github.com/openhat-security/runhug">openhat-security/runhug</a></p>
  <pre>curl -fsSL @REPO_URL@/install-apt.sh | sudo bash
curl -fsSL @REPO_URL@/install-dnf.sh | sudo bash</pre>

  <h2>truffles</h2>
  <p><a href="https://github.com/openhat-security/truffles">openhat-security/truffles</a></p>
  <pre>curl -fsSL @REPO_URL@/install-apt-truffles.sh | sudo bash
curl -fsSL @REPO_URL@/install-dnf-truffles.sh | sudo bash</pre>

  <p>Lists: <a href="runhug.list">runhug.list</a> · <a href="truffles.list">truffles.list</a> ·
     repos: <a href="runhug.repo">runhug.repo</a> · <a href="truffles.repo">truffles.repo</a></p>
</body>
</html>
